WEBVTT

NOTE Automatic captions from the source audio; editorial review pending.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
[Music]

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:10.960
The leaf is turning, but what colour will
it be?

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:15.020
Look closer, change is the very nature of
being.

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:19.380
From a moment to a memory, drenched
clothes to fur coats,

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:23.320
a shack to a skyscraper, radical to a
plant,

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:25.700
the universe has come a long way.

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:29.700
There will be a few misses with
approaching patchy shadows,

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:32.840
but will surely be followed by a clear
sky.

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:36.080
Let us join hands to replace patterns,

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:39.340
to create, witness and approach a new
goal.

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:42.320
Let us shatter the shroud of the leaves.

00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:46.120
Petals fade, but let not our minds and
hearts.

00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:48.680
Slap your wings with the flowing change.

00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:52.980
Allow change for the unknown, the unborn
and the alchemy.

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:56.820
Accept change as we are no slaves to time
and mind.

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:01.640
Embrace change as we are all about man's
attempt at false stability.

00:01:02.140 --> 00:01:05.160
Shuffle and reshuffle to unravel
positivity

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:07.820
and to make us love and live more.

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:11.800
Let us all unite to accelerate the
paradigm shift.

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:20.600
[Music]
